l","role":"Kirsten, DR employee","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dtORcPxv8MUVafoR7h7APn018gL.jpg"},{"id":1954949,"name":"Ida Maria Vinterberg","role":"Frejas friend"},{"id":1664404,"name":"Oliver Methling Søndergaard","role":"Johannes","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dI5EdDwtNy8HOL2g2s13vYhSzRH.jpg"},{"id":1087001,"name":"Jesper Hyldegaard","role":"DR Chef","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tqQOVuOLKzFcLbH10S7CRpR1wGA.jpg"},{"id":1944591,"name":"Ulver Skuli Abildgaard","role":"Preben","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4IdeRpii3XvrwjWhyXV32Kbsq52.jpg"},{"id":71188,"name":"Morten Rose","role":"Editorial employee","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yZmEuiZpDuFnNLv8EB4rGQMC73N.jpg"},{"id":1954950,"name":"Mikael Kærsgaard","role":"Guitarist"},{"id":1954951,"name":"Sigga Eythorsdottir","role":"Choirleader"},{"id":1150401,"name":"Lise Koefoed","role":"Make-up artist","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sUoczyHegxe4zsORNfGj9bEk3df.jpg"},{"id":2173588,"name":"Henrik Strube","role":"Older man"},{"id":1494872,"name":"Adam Fischer","role":"Architect Student"},{"id":1034508,"name":"Ole Dupont","role":"Elegant Gentleman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hZEasReBVUddwg2f4qmxAG9hA79.jpg"},{"id":3069206,"name":"Sanny Jakobsen","role":"Student"},{"id":1668269,"name":"Claus Sprotte Kofod","role":"Student"},{"id":1855176,"name":"Erling Agergaard","role":"DR stage manager (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mkIyKc8kRnlG1EVvGKU50myrZ7R.jpg"},{"id":2640837,"name":"Morten Feldt","role":"DR Technician (uncredited)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La comune","overview":"Erik e Anna sono una coppia di intellettuali con un sogno. Insieme alla figlia Freja, fondano una comune nell'enorme villa di Erik in un elegante quartiere di Copenhagen. Con la loro famiglia al centro della storia, siamo invitati ad entrare nel sogno di una vera comune: partecipiamo alle riunioni sulla gestione della casa, alle cene e alle feste. Amicizia, amore e condivisione sotto uno stesso tetto fino a quando una sconvolgente storia d'amore metterà la comunità e la comune stessa di fronte alla prova più dura che abbiano mai affrontato."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Commune","overview":"A funny and moving story of family and free love set in a freewheeling 1970s commune. When Anna and Erik inherit a huge house, they gather a motley crew of cohabitants to reinvigorate their lives, forcing them to reconcile their new values with old habits.","tagline":"You Choose Your Family"},{"language":"da-DA","overview":"For akademikerparret Erik og Anna begynder det hele som en drøm. Sammen med datteren Freja etablerer de et kollektiv i Eriks store kasse af en villa i Hellerup. Med familien som fortællingens midtpunkt, inviteres vi ind i drømmen om et ægte kollektiv. Vi er med til husmøderne, middagene og festerne. Det er venskab, kærlighed, familie og fællesskab under samme tag, indtil en jordrystende forelskelse sætter fællesskabet og kollektivet på den ultimative prøve. \"Kollektivet\" er et portræt af en hel generation. Filmen er en kærlighedserklæring til en generation af idealister og drømmere, der for længst er vågnet op til virkeligheden."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4a3U9pZZGw7xbrd4U72AO2cRVVa.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4a3U9pZZGw7xbrd4U72AO2cRVVa.png","language":"da","width":1303,"height":282}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pyG0tH6k58cQ5c8BgGDyfnto16.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pyG0tH6k58cQ5c8BgGDyfnto16.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lR3qD373HpydCl23pYMC4JfVf6B.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lR3qD373HpydCl23pYMC4JfVf6B.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height